# Append-mostly project-cycle trackers: auto-merge concurrent appends instead
# of conflicting. Ids are UNIX-epoch timestamps and entries are append-only +
# sorted-on-read, so union keeping both sides is safe. The one operation union
# can't merge is moving an entry between sections — do that only at release
# migration (single-owner). See CLAUDE.md.
bugs.md      merge=union
features.md  merge=union
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
